				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "28-pin (2x14, 0.6in row spacing) DIP-form USB Hi-Speed FT232H dev module -- plugs into a standard 0.6in 28-pin DIP socket. Pin names/numbers taken verbatim from DS_UM232H.pdf Figure 10 (module circuit schematic) cross-checked against Tables 2-4 and Figure 2 (pinout): J1 is the AC-bus/power connector (GND, 5V0, USB, RST#, AC9..AC0), J2 is the AD-bus/UART connector (SLD, VIO, 3V3, PU2, PU1, GND, AD0..AD7). Pin numbers keep the datasheet's own J1-n/J2-n designators since J1 and J2 are electrically independent connectors each locally numbered 1-14 (not a single wrap-around DIP numbering) -- must match the UM232H footprint's pad names exactly. AC0-9/AD0-7 are all left as passive (mode-dependent -- see ACBUS Signal Options / Signal Descriptions tables for the function under each configuration, default is TriSt-PU/async-serial)."
			(at 299.72 326.39 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(justify left)
			)
		)
